			"notes": {
				"rationale": "ihn names who does the repairing, so lassen is the VERB lassen and reparieren a target of its own (de/causative-lassen, #721). Read as causative, 'have him repair the car' (Duden lassen 1a), as ADR 0026 lists lässt ihn reparieren beside lässt es von ihm reparieren; the permissive 'let him repair it' is also possible in isolation. Causative lassen is 🗣👉, relabelled from 🫴, which read as handing something over (user, 2026-10-03, #877). Knowledge (#887, dev draft): E-VALBU has no causative Lesart, so the frame is Duden's 'Infinitiv + Akkusativ', the Akkusativ Optional by its 'auch ohne Akkusativ'."
			},
